ward again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal is simple: help Sohee smile once more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/749ef2beeb24b9f25f9358f5f250a267.poster.avif?t=1762254963\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/749ef2beeb24b9f25f9358f5f250a267.webm?t=1762254963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/749ef2beeb24b9f25f9358f5f250a267.mp4?t=1762254963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragments of emotion hidden in everyday life</strong><br>Explore Sohee\u2019s surroundings and interact with objects as you participate in her quiet, personal journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle changes through meaningful choices</strong><br>Sohee\u2019s emotional path may shift based on the small choices you make along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive experience with minimal guidance</strong><br>There are few explanations\u2014players are encouraged to discover the meaning of each scene on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short, but emotionally rich story</strong><br>In just about an hour, experience a full spectrum of emotions\u2014love, loss, forgiveness, and personal growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/170bdf13e454fcce4a069b2b1106d216.poster.avif?t=1762254963\" wi